# markdown-reader
===
 Local-first cross-platform Markdown editor with tabs, live preview, AI chat & translation, sentence comparison, slash commands, citations, document import, advanced tables, browser preview, export, and support for OpenAI, Anthropic, OpenRouter, LM Studio, Ollama & compatible APIs.
